2026-06-10 09:58:08,545 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To address the City of Belval's demands for strict GDPR compliance, we can leverage our existing capabilities. For data hosting, our standard data residency is in the EU only, which aligns with the requirement that data must be hosted exclusively in the EU. We also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside the EU by default unless there is an explicit legal basis for doing so.

