To further ensure compliance, we adhere to the principles of privacy by design and default, incorporating data protection into our processing activities and ensuring that only necessary data is processed for the intended purpose. Our GDPR posture includes implementing data subject rights such as access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection, which will be crucial in maintaining transparency and compliance.

Lastly, given our experience with regulatory frameworks including RGPD/GDPR, we are well-equipped to navigate the complexities of GDPR compliance and implement the necessary security controls and measures to meet the City of Belval's requirements.
