4. Confirmation that we will adhere to the City of Belval's policy of sustainable development and reduce energetic consumption.

By addressing these legal risks and requirements, we can ensure that our proposal is compliant with the City of Belval's call for tenders and demonstrates our commitment to meeting their regulatory and contractual needs.
